~A game where you erect dispensers POOTIS and massive sentry guns with goddamn rockets, make your enemies bleed with a shotgun only to then beat them with a wrench. A game called Team Fortress 2. {Engineer}.
~A game where you take a goddamn ghost buster gun, shove it up your teammates'♥♥♥♥♥ making them invincible to everything while wielding an automatic gun that shoots syringes. A game called Team Fortress 2. {Medic}
